@baseUrl = http://localhost:5087
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}
@token2 = {{login2.response.body.$.token}}

### ============ FLUJO DEL DUEÑO ============

### 1. Lista de restaurantes (vacía al principio)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants

### 2. Registro de dueño
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tomás",
  "email": "tomas@test.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura123",
  "restaurantName": "La Parrilla de Tomás",
  "address": "Av. Colón 1234, Córdoba",
  "phone": "5493511234567",
  "openingTime": "12:00:00",
  "closingTime": "23:30:00"
}

### 3. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tomas@test.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura123"
}

### 4. Ver mi cuenta
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Crear categoría
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hamburguesas"
}

### 6. Crear producto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hamburguesa completa",
  "description": "Doble carne, cheddar, panceta y huevo",
  "price": 12500,
  "imageUrl": null,
  "isFeatured": true,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 7. Poner 20% de descuento
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/discount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountPercentage": 20
}

### 8. Activar happy hour
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/happy-hour
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isHappyHour": true
}

### ============ FLUJO DEL INVITADO ============

### 9. Lista de restaurantes (ahora con uno)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants

### 10. Menú completo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/1/menu

### 11. Productos de una categoría
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1/products

### 12. Detalle de un producto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### ============ PRUEBAS DE ERRORES ============

### 13. Sin token (espera 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bebidas"
}

### 14. Descuento inválido (espera 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/discount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountPercentage": 150
}

### 15. Login con contraseña incorrecta (espera 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tomas@test.com",
  "password": "otraClave"
}

### 16. Registro con email repetido, en mayúsculas (espera 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Otro",
  "email": "TOMAS@test.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura123",
  "restaurantName": "Otro local",
  "address": "Calle 123",
  "phone": "5493519999999",
  "openingTime": "09:00:00",
  "closingTime": "18:00:00"
}

### ============ SEGURIDAD ENTRE DUEÑOS ============

### 17. Registrar un segundo dueño
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura123",
  "restaurantName": "Café de Ana",
  "address": "Bv. San Juan 500, Córdoba",
  "phone": "5493517654321",
  "openingTime": "08:00:00",
  "closingTime": "20:00:00"
}

### 18. Login del segundo dueño
# @name login2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura123"
}

### 19. Ana intenta borrar el producto de Tomás (espera 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### 20. Ana intenta crear un producto en la categoría de Tomás (espera 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Producto intruso",
  "description": "",
  "price": 100,
  "isFeatured": false,
  "categoryId": 1
}